1
00:00:00,258 --> 00:00:02,178
(Penny:)Every family in America has a relative...

2
00:00:02,343 --> 00:00:05,473
(Penny:)...holed up in a garage somewhere
huffing paint thinner.

3
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:09,100
(Howard(after Raj whispers in his ear):)No, I'm lost too.
I think she skipped a step.

4
00:00:09,892 --> 00:00:14,312
Now, look, Sheldon's cousin Leo escaped
rehab and he's in a Motel 8 in Long Beach.

5
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:16,730
(Penny:)The whole family's going out
for an intervention.

6
00:00:16,899 --> 00:00:19,609
(Penny:)Leonard is driving Sheldon down
to help him through this...

7
00:00:19,777 --> 00:00:23,617
(Penny:)- ...because he's such a good man.
- Oh, another hug? Thank you.

8
00:00:25,074 --> 00:00:27,574
- All right, you guys. Good luck.
- Thanks, Penny.

9
00:00:27,744 --> 00:00:29,494
(Howard:)- Break a leg.
- Yeah, break a leg.

10
00:00:31,038 --> 00:00:32,458
(Howard:)So road trip to Long Beach.

11
00:00:32,623 --> 00:00:35,003
(Leonard:)- We're not going to Long Beach.
- Why not?

12
00:00:35,168 --> 00:00:38,208
(Leonard:)Because Sheldon doesn't have
a drug-addicted cousin Leopold.

13
00:00:38,379 --> 00:00:40,169
(Penny:)Oh, too bad.

14
00:00:40,882 --> 00:00:43,172
(Raj:)I've always wanted to go to Long Beach.

15
00:00:43,342 --> 00:00:46,132
(Sheldon:)It's a very nice community.
The Queen Mary is docked there.

16
00:00:46,304 --> 00:00:49,684
Once the largest liner in the world,
it's now a hotel and restaurant...

17
00:00:49,849 --> 00:00:52,849
(Sheldon:)...where they host a surprisingly gripping
murder-mystery dinner.

18
00:00:53,770 --> 00:00:54,810
- Sounds fun.
- I'm game.

19
00:00:54,979 --> 00:00:57,189
- Shotgun.
- No, no, no.

20
00:00:57,899 --> 00:01:03,019
(Sheldon:)Leonard gets nauseous unless
he sits in front, and even then it's iffy.

